Kontakt: [admitere@liceulhonterusbrasov.ro](mailto:admitere@liceulhonterusbrasov.ro) · Sekretariat 0268 470 802

body_md.en:
Candidates allocated to the “Johannes Honterus” National College for 2026–27 enrol on **23, 24 and 27 July 2026**.

**Year 8 leavers from the college** complete the [Year 9 enrolment form](https://liceulhonterusbrasov.ro/lic/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Cerere-inscriere-cl-a-IX-a_2026_2027.pdf) and send it to [inscriereliceu2026@liceulhonterusbrasov.ro](mailto:inscriereliceu2026@liceulhonterusbrasov.ro) or hand it in at the school office. No other documents are required.

**Candidates from other schools** submit the following at the school office (23, 24 and 27 July, 11:00–13:00) or by email to the same address:

- the enrolment form, fully completed;
- birth certificate – copy;
- identity card, where applicable – copy;
- transcript of marks for Years 5–8 (*foaia matricolă*) – copy;
- certificate showing the National Assessment marks, the Years 5–8 average and the admission average – copy;
- medical record (*fișa medicală*) – copy.

Candidates allocated to other schools may collect their files on the same days, 09:00–11:00.

**Please note:** candidates who do not submit the enrolment form during this period are deemed to have withdrawn, and their places are declared vacant.

**For Year 8 pupils and their parents**

- 14 July 2026, 16:00–18:00 – completing the choices on the application form, assisted by form teachers;
- 16 July 2026, 16:00–18:00 – checking the printed form, correcting any errors and printing.

An incorrect choice may lead to an unwanted allocation; too few choices may mean the candidate is not allocated by the computerised process.

**German mother-tongue proficiency test:** [registration form](https://liceulhonterusbrasov.ro/lic/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Cerere_inscriere_test_limba_germana_materna.pdf) · [Brașov School Inspectorate procedure](https://www.isjbrasov.ro/index.php/examene-concursuri/admitere/7052-po-verificare-bl-materna)

**Official information** (in Romanian): [admission calendar 2026–27](https://www.edu.ro/sites/default/files/_fi%C8%99iere/Legislatie/2025/Calendar-Admitere-Liceu-2026-2027.pdf) · [Ministry of Education – admissions](https://www.edu.ro/admitere-liceu-si-inv-profesional) · [Brașov School Inspectorate – Year 9 places](https://isjbrasov.ro/index.php/examene-concursuri/admitere/7210-oferta-educationala-pentru-clasa-a-ix-a-2026-2027)

