Subjects: Romanian language and literature, German (mother tongue) language and literature, mathematics.

- 16 March 2026 – Romanian language and literature, written paper;
- 17 March 2026 – mathematics, written paper;
- 18 March 2026 – mother-tongue language and literature, written paper;
- 30 March 2026 – results.

**Mock baccalaureate – written papers**

Subjects: Romanian language and literature, German (mother tongue) language and literature, mathematics, history, physics, chemistry, biology, computer science, geography, logic, argumentation and communication, psychology, economics, sociology, philosophy.

- 23 March 2026 – paper E.a: Romanian language and literature;
- 24 March 2026 – paper E.c: compulsory subject of the track;
- 25 March 2026 – paper E.d: elective subject of the track and specialisation;
- 26 March 2026 – paper E.b: mother-tongue language and literature.

Syllabuses for the mock examinations (in Romanian): [subiecte.edu.ro – mock examinations 2026](https://subiecte.edu.ro/2026/simulare/legislatie/)

